{"id":"n60116-1-10","stage":3,"title":"부근 · 附近","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n60116-1-10-1","ko":"도착하려면 아직 멀었어?","zh":"还要走很久才能到吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"도착하려면","meaning":"到达","explanation":"도착하다：到达；려면：表示实现意图所需的条件：“如果想要……”。","readings":[{"term":"도착하다","audio":"/audio/a914f00b23a9d60f89e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70745","senseId":"1","lemma":"도착하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아직","meaning":"尚未，还，仍然","explanation":"아직：尚未，还，仍然","readings":[{"term":"아직","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71254","senseId":"1","lemma":"아직","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"멀었어?","meaning":"还早，还不到","explanation":"멀다：还早，还不到；었：过去或完成，常与词干缩合。；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"멀다","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26833","senseId":"4","lemma":"멀다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a914f00b23a9d60f","term":"도착하다","zh":"到达","audio":"/audio/a914f00b23a9d60f89e8.mp3","entryId":"70745","definition":"抵达目的地。","pronunciation":["도ː차카다"]},{"id":"fc3d924ec6725c21","term":"아직","zh":"尚未，还，仍然","audio":"/audio/fc3d924ec6725c21b50b.mp3","entryId":"71254","definition":"表示某事或状态成为怎么样需要过一段时间， 或者某事或状态不结束继续不断。","pronunciation":["아직"]},{"id":"e6d01e903c854714","term":"멀다","zh":"还早，还不到","audio":"/audio/e6d01e903c854714b601.mp3","entryId":"26833","definition":"到现在还剩较长一段时间；尚需很长时间。","pronunciation":["멀ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/24201dd7c0aa874e61fa.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n60116-1-10-2","ko":"지금 너희 집 부근이니까 곧 도착할 거야.","zh":"现在就在你们家附近，应该很快就能到了。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"지금","meaning":"现在，这会儿","explanation":"지금：现在，这会儿","readings":[{"term":"지금","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62523","senseId":"1","lemma":"지금","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"너희","meaning":"你们","explanation":"너희：你们","readings":[{"term":"너희","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"61180","senseId":"1","lemma":"너희","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"부근이니까","meaning":"附近，周边","explanation":"부근：附近，周边；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；니까：提出原因、依据，或说明经历前一动作后发现的情况。","readings":[{"term":"부근","audio":"/audio/d4f019ca8d202a59215c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60116","senseId":"1","lemma":"부근","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"곧","meaning":"就，马上，即将","explanation":"곧：就，马上，即将","readings":[{"term":"곧","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26802","senseId":"2","lemma":"곧","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"도착할","meaning":"到达","explanation":"도착하다：到达；ㄹ：修饰后面的名词，表示预定、意向、推测或可能；具体含义取决于后接表达。","readings":[{"term":"도착하다","audio":"/audio/a914f00b23a9d60f89e8.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70745","senseId":"1","lemma":"도착하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거야.","meaning":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","explanation":"거：表示说话人的推测或信念等。；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"5","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"df159f47a890ff65","term":"지금","zh":"现在，这会儿","audio":"/audio/df159f47a890ff655039.mp3","entryId":"62523","definition":"在说话的当时；或此时此刻。","pronunciation":["지금"]},{"id":"ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba","term":"너희","zh":"你们","audio":"/audio/ab3c37ad0aa2e0ba11c1.mp3","entryId":"61180","definition":"指代多个听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너히"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"d4f019ca8d202a59","term":"부근","zh":"附近，周边","audio":"/audio/d4f019ca8d202a59215c.mp3","entryId":"60116","definition":"以某地为中心，指离该地很近的地方。","pronunciation":["부ː근"]},{"id":"c2f53c24d7797085","term":"곧","zh":"就，马上，即将","audio":"/audio/c2f53c24d77970856333.mp3","entryId":"26802","definition":"时间没过多久。","pronunciation":["곧"]},{"id":"a914f00b23a9d60f","term":"도착하다","zh":"到达","audio":"/audio/a914f00b23a9d60f89e8.mp3","entryId":"70745","definition":"抵达目的地。","pronunciation":["도ː차카다"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"表示说话人的推测或信念等。","pronunciation":["거"]}],"audio":"/audio/a1f8a5b5cc239111260c.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.051,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=60116","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":111,"sequenceScore":2.8777,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["现在就在你们家附近，应该很快就能到了。","还要走很久才能到吗？","要和我们一起学习吗？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["还要走很久才能到吗？","要和我们一起学习吗？","现在就在你们家附近，应该很快就能到了。"],"answer":2}]}
